'''Sahrotaar''' is a unique [[Skyrim:Serpentine Dragon|serpentine dragon]] found inside the ''[[Skyrim:Black Book: Waking Dreams (book)|Black Book: Waking Dreams]]'' during the quest [[Skyrim:At the Summit of Apocrypha|At the Summit of Apocrypha]]. 

His name might mean either "Mighty Servant" or "Phantom Word Servant" in the [[Lore:Dragon Language|dragon language]].

Sahrotaar will appear after you learn the [[Skyrim:Dragon Aspect|Dragon Aspect]] shout, and it is then necessary to use the [[Skyrim:Bend Will|Bend Will]] shout on him to tame him and progress through the quest. 

Sahrotaar knows the following shouts: [[Skyrim:Frost_Breath|Frost Breath]], [[Skyrim:Ice Storm (shout)|Ice Storm]], and [[Skyrim:Unrelenting_Force|Unrelenting Force]].
